    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27597" root="ظل" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِلَالٌ</span></b>  pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِلٌّ</span>: (S, M, O, K:) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُلَّةٌ</span>. (M, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Also, app., pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَلِيلٌ</span>: see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِلَّةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  Freytag has app. understood it to be
expl. in the K as syn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَظَلَّةٌ</span>; though it
certainly is not.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَلَالٌ</span>.

